      "delivery": "AUTO_ON_STAGE",
      "content": "第一幕开场：宣读公共案情，确认六名玩家就位。\n可发放线索：血迹照片。不要提前发放烧毁账册。",
      "title": "主持·第一幕后台",
      "sourceRef": {
        "sourceType": "HOST_SCRIPT",
        "sourceDocumentId": "doc_host_manual",
        "stageId": "stage_1",
        "sectionId": "host_s1",
        "label": "主持·第一幕后台"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cu_host_host_s2",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "stageId": "stage_2",
      "audience": {
        "roleIds": [
          "role_host"
        ],
        "visibility": "HOST_ONLY"
      },
      "delivery": "AUTO_ON_STAGE",
      "content": "宣布商会规则：库房只允许一人进入。\n启动库房进入资格竞价（M03）。赢家将获得查看烧毁账册的权限。",
      "title": "主持·第二幕后台",
      "sourceRef": {
        "sourceType": "HOST_SCRIPT",
        "sourceDocumentId": "doc_host_manual",
        "stageId": "stage_2",
        "sectionId": "host_s2",
        "label": "主持·第二幕后台"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cu_host_host_s3",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "stageId": "stage_3",
      "audience": {
        "roleIds": [
          "role_host"
        ],
        "visibility": "HOST_ONLY"
      },
      "delivery": "AUTO_ON_STAGE",
      "content": "发放关键线索：库房钥匙残件。确认赢家是否已读私人账册内容。",
      "title": "主持·第三幕后台",
      "sourceRef": {
        "sourceType": "HOST_SCRIPT",
        "sourceDocumentId": "doc_host_manual",
        "stageId": "stage_3",
        "sectionId": "host_s3",
        "label": "主持·第三幕后台"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cu_host_host_s4",
      "type": "TEXT",
      "stageId": "stage_4",
      "audience": {
        "roleIds": [
          "role_host"
        ],
        "visibility": "HOST_ONLY"
      },
      "delivery": "AUTO_ON_STAGE",
      "content": "启动最终指凶投票（M09）。按多数票宣读结算。",
      "title": "主持·终幕后台",
      "sourceRef": {
        "sourceType": "HOST_SCRIPT",
        "sourceDocumentId": "doc_host_manual",
        "stageId": "stage_4",
        "sectionId": "host_s4",
        "label": "主持·终幕后台"
      }
    },
