      "audience": {
        "roleIds": [
          "role_a"
        ],
        "visibility": "PRIVATE"
      },
      "delivery": "AUTO_ON_STAGE",
      "content": "商会宣布库房只许一人进入。你决定参与争夺进入资格。",
      "title": "沈孤鸿·第二幕",
      "sourceRef": {
        "sourceType": "CHARACTER_SCRIPT",
